    "lead": "The Supreme Court upheld the removal of interest for the periods before arbitration began and while it was pending. In this contract, Clause 26 excluded both periods. The sums awarded for the underlying claims and the post-award interest were outside the issue decided on this appeal. (Paras. 2–6 and 17–20.)",
