    "lead": "The Supreme Court set aside a conviction for aggravated sexual assault under the Protection of Children from Sexual Offences Act. The Court assessed the prosecution’s evidence as a whole and found that it did not establish guilt beyond reasonable doubt. The judgment concerns the record in this particular prosecution. (Paras. 62–66.)",
