    "lead": "The Supreme Court directed the Union to pursue a consultative review of rules on pharmaceutical marketing, with recommendations and a compliance affidavit to follow. The order addresses regulatory design and enforcement concerns raised under the right to health. The matter remained part-heard at the date of the order. (Paras. 21–25.)",
