      "## What the teachers argued",
      "Direct recruits in aided schools sought parity with teachers entering the cadre through transfer or promotion. The Division Bench reversed the relief previously granted. The Supreme Court examined qualifications, duties, responsibilities and the experience accompanying the two routes into the cadre.",
